# API testing

## Execute Log In
POST http://localhost:3001/api/sessions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user",
    "password": "testpass"
}

###

## Checking if user is still logged-in.
GET http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current HTTP/1.1

###

## Execute Log Out.
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current HTTP/1.1

###

GET http://localhost:3001/api/images/pick HTTP/1.1

###

## Get 3 random images
GET http://localhost:3001/api/images HTTP/1.1
###

## Get a deck of 7 captions
GET http://localhost:3001/api/images/1/captions HTTP/1.1
###

## Search for the correct captions
POST http://localhost:3001/api/images/1/captions HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

[
    8, 
    10, 
    11, 
    7, 
    5, 
    1, 
    3
]

###

POST http://localhost:3001/api/history HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

[
    {
        "imageId": 1,
        "isCorrect": true 
    },
    {
        "imageId": 2,
        "isCorrect": false 
    },
    {
        "imageId": 3,
        "isCorrect": true 
    }
]

###

GET http://localhost:3001/api/history HTTP/1.1

###

GET http://localhost:3001/api/history/1 HTTP/1.1